From 3d27474ab109f7c19330342e941dcbabad07e782 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: mminin <mminin2010@gmail.com>
Date: Tue, 13 Oct 2026 15:08:51 -0700
Subject: [PATCH] Show dynamic XFA forms

PDF files with dynamic XFA forms only contain a "please use Adobe Reader"
page. With poppler 26.11, show the pages poppler lays out from the form
instead, with working form fields.

The scripts of such forms run when their fields change, and may change
the pages: EvDocumentForms gets rerender() for backends to return a new
document then, which EvView puts in place of the old one, and
take_messages(), take_urls() and take_print_request() for what the
scripts ask the viewer to do. Push buttons now set their state, which
clicks them in XFA forms.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
